                                "example_id": "eed8ea23-acf6-4497-bc07-d1f71fc76353",
                                "sense_id": "247d3ec1-6fcd-3af2-a268-ddbb3bea63c4",
                                "text": "Anthony de Leva, seeing the Emperor his master resolutely obstinate to undertake that voyage, and deeming it wonderfully glorious, maintained neverthelesse the contrarie, and discounselled him from it[…]."
